      "steps": [
        "Each time you pass the clock, read it.",
        "Say it the clock way: quarter past, 20 to...",
        "Can you catch it at exactly quarter to?"
      ],
      "why": "Reading real clocks often is what makes it stick."
    },
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "debrief": [
